{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Dance of Maple Leaves It is a single player RPG real-time combat development game. The trial version will provide a complete main city map task system, a replica map, equipment appraisal system, and equipment attribute upgrade system with a level limit of 30</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay 1: A super large open exploration map of the main city, with a main city mission system, follow the mission step by step to improve your equipment level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay 2: Challenge the dungeon leader to obtain epic equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay 3: Appraisal system, so all equipment can be appraised and additional entry attributes can be obtained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay 4: Equipment attribute upgrade system, so basic attributes of equipment can be upgraded up to 10 points, such as attack, critical strike, etc.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685070?t=1745562802","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685070?t=1745562802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685070/825d4d8381dcd2d146c62125d9805f23a5ce0a86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745562802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685070/825d4d8381dcd2d146c62125d9805f23a5ce0a86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745562802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Dance of Maple Leaves It is a single player RPG real-time combat development game. The trial version will provide a complete main city map task system, a replica map, equipment appraisal system, and equipment attribute upgrade system with a level limit of 30</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay 1: A super large open exploration map of th